default_des:
feat: 
1. Added support for certificate method login certificate with password;
fix:
1. Adjust the first 1M content to read from large files to the last 1M content;
2. Increase in international information on inaccessible addresses;
3. Fixed the problem that remotely downloaded files will not automatically follow the jump address;

feat: 
1. Support scenarios for sudo user password verification under certificate login;
fix:
1. Fixed the problem that the terminal will be disconnected when running in the background;
2. Fixed the problem that incorrect server time would cause the token to expire and become invalid;
perf:
1. Optimize initialization speed;
2. Optimize Delete key operation;
3. Optimize overall access speed;

feat:
1. Add the function of supporting commonly used commands on the terminal;
2. Supports automatic reconnection when the terminal is disconnected and re-focused;
3. Increase server resource usage display;
4. Add task manager applications;
5. Increase online customer service to make it convenient to contact customer service at any time;
6. Compatible with arm architecture chips;
change:
1. Adjustment directory does not perform size calculation by default (too much content under the folder will cause the interface speed to be slow);
2. File manager right click on the mouse to point to the name and not point to the name for different logical adjustments;
perf:
1. Optimize the size of front-end resources;

des.des:
feat:
1. 增加支持终端联想常用命令功能;
2. 支持终端在断开连接后重新聚焦时自动重连;
3. 增加服务器资源占用显示;
4. 增加任务管理器应用;
5. 增加在线客服，方便随时联系客服;
6. 兼容 arm 架构芯片;

change:
1. 调整目录默认不做大小计算(文件夹下内容多会导致接口速度慢);
2. 文件管理器右键在鼠标指向名称和不指向名称的不同逻辑调整;

perf:
1. 优化前端资源大小；
